  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W2 \u2014 Initial assessment booking \u00b7 Physiotherapy practice\n\n**Boundary: automated proposal, human confirm above CHF 1000.**\nA standard prescribed series of nine sessions comes to roughly CHF 900 to 1,200 depending on session length and whether the payer is an insurer or the patient, so CHF 1,000 is the point at which an enquiry stops being a routine single series and becomes an extended or combined programme that a therapist should confirm before anything priced is sent out. Scored 3/2/4.\n\n### The measurable thing here is travel\nClustering by locality is the whole point. Travel minutes per course of treatment, before and after, is unambiguous and it converts directly to money \u2014 the easiest result in the whole project to defend.\n\nRecord the unclustered estimate too, or you have nothing to compare against. The **Cluster by locality** node writes both.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "aae36f08-034a-412e-91b6-6e6ceb759383",
      "name": "Note 1",
